      <h1>Low-FODMAP Diet</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">A short-term diagnostic elimination diet developed for irritable bowel syndrome — not a general long-term eating plan.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="ghost-btn" href="/diets/">← Back to Diets</a>
